INPUTLOG - a live keyboard + mouse monitor drawn on the screen.

Language features
  - SEED_KEYWORD statement (INPUTLOG or INPUTLOG x, y)
  - polling the keyboard and mouse from a seed (keys, modifiers, buttons)
  - <graphics.h> with double buffering for a flicker-free panel

Try it
  INPUTLOG                     REM panel at top-left
    INPUTLOG 300, 200            REM at your own position

Build it on the machine
  grow inputlog          # -> build/INPUTLOG.SED
  (grow links the berry-libc from SEEDCORE.PKT for this one automatically)
It is also prebuilt in /SEED as INPUTLOG.SED, ready to use.

